+# ![logo](logo.png) MatrixBridgeMerge
+
+MatrixBridgeMerge links the same group from WhatsApp, Signal, LINE and other mautrix bridges into one Matrix room. It runs as the `linker` bot, reads each bridge's database read-only and makes changes through the bridge's own commands, so the bridges run unmodified. See [the MatrixBridgeMerge guide](docs/setup/bridge-management.md).
+
+MatrixBridgeMerge is built on Matrix Hookshot. The original Hookshot documentation follows.
+
+## Matrix Hookshot
 
